"block_order":["template--14491778449537__5ceab13d-4e5e-49e8-939d-f338644a5c14-168329114236b7c3f0-0"],"settings":{"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto","parallax":false,"style":"bars","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_34_8a603c41-d203-48f8-8f4d-1a6e233522f4.png","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"Versatile Floor Protection","text":"<p>Chair mats prevent hard floors from wear and damage. Use in a wide range of applications including hardwood and carpet.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text-and-image":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 19px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_30_b3383a90-bedf-4f20-b314-a273752dda31.png","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"Lipped or Rectangular Shape","text":"<p>Choose between a lipped or rectangular shape to fit your needs. Available in multiple sizes to offer the best customization.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"background-image-text":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"Impressive","title":"About your brand","text":"<p>Pair large text with a full-width image to draw attention to an important detail of your brand or product line.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Simple Installation"}},"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>In four simple and fast steps, you can have your surface fully installed in minutes or less.<\/p><p><strong>Getting Started<\/strong><\/p><p>The panels have two sides with female PowerLocks, and two sides with male PowerLocks. All tiles on any given installation should always have the female PowerLocks going in the same direction.<\/p><p><strong>Step One<\/strong><\/p><p>Begin the installation by laying down your first panel in any one corner and pointing the female PowerLocks in the two directions that additional panels are to be added.<\/p><p><strong>Step Two<\/strong><\/p><p>Place the next panel so that the male PowerLock line up over the top of the female loops on the first panel. It's important to make sure that the female PowerLocks are facing exactly the same direction as the first panel.<\/p><p><strong>Step Three<\/strong><\/p><p>Gently step along the joint of the two panels. You will hear and feel the PowerLocks snap into place as you go.<\/p><p><strong>Step Four<\/strong><\/p><p>Once the two panels are joined, repeat steps one through three remembering to keep the female PowerLocks aligned until your floor is complete. That's all there is to this easy-to-install flooring!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0","template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","disabled":true,"blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"SNOW, MUD\n& DAMAGE","title_size":60,"subheading":"CONTAIN THEM WITH THE FLOOR DEFENDER","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/205bf0dd43474cadbc436af39a1133dd.mp4","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"REGULAR VS PRO GRADE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>The underside of Floor Defender Pro Garage Containment Mats features a tatami grain pattern for increased traction. This patterned backing prevents these mats from lifting and allows them to retain their shape over extended periods of time. Also, the tatami grain patterned backing produces a smoother, less wrinkled surface than the smooth backed regular Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_24_19_294Z.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION","title":"NO MUDDY MESS","text":"<p>Dirt, Dust, and Debris are no problem as the Floor Defender Containment Mat catches it all and keeps it from being tracked into the house.<\/p><p>The Floor Defenders will hold up to 62 gallons of water at once and keep it off your floors until you are ready to safely empty it outside your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_38_17_168Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION MATS","title":"PROTECT AGAINST CHEMICALS","text":"<p>Keep oil, geese, anti-freeze, and other chemicals that may drain out of your car contained, and away from other possessions stored in the garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_42_33_705Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Improved","title":"EASY CLEAN UP","text":"<p>Floor defenders are very easy to clean, simply drag the mat outside with all its contents and hose it down. In a matter of minutes, the mat is ready to be redeployed and used all over again.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_45_06_105Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"SIMPLE & COMPACT STORAGE","text":"<p>Although the Floor Defender Mats can be used year round, some of our customers prefer to only have the mats out in the winter.<\/p><p>Storing these mats after winter is incredibly easy. Simply roll them back up into a compact size and store it way in your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\"><strong>Got Questions? Learn more about our Floor Defender Garage Continment Mats ❗HERE<\/strong><\/a>❗<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1","c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f220664d-cc7b-4aea-a660-b60af2d6dd55":{"type":"featured-collection","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Featured collection","home_featured_products":"garage-flooring","per_row":4,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":false,"divider":false}},"recently-viewed":{"type":"recently-viewe